@api = http://127.0.0.1:5101
@token = PASTE_SHORT_LIVED_DEMO_TOKEN_FROM_START_SCRIPT

### Swagger/OpenAPI real
GET {{api}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json

### Demo 1: traditional CRUD DTO
GET {{api}}/orders?customerId=cus-contoso&status=Pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Demo 2: intentional teaching failure — 400 INVALID_ORDER_STATUS, no write
GET {{api}}/orders?customerId=Contoso&status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Improved REST uses the same Application as MCP
GET {{api}}/capabilities/pending-orders?customerId=cus-contoso
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Evidence, permitted actions and signed review token
GET {{api}}/capabilities/orders/ORD-1004/review-context
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Default is NOT confirmed — 409, no mutation (paste real reviewToken)
POST {{api}}/orders/ORD-1004/cancellation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo:manual-001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reviewToken": "PASTE_REVIEW_TOKEN", "confirmed": false }

### Explicit confirmed write; retry identical payload/key -> alreadyApplied true
POST {{api}}/orders/ORD-1004/cancellation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo:manual-001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reviewToken": "PASTE_REVIEW_TOKEN", "confirmed": true }

### Create synthetic CRUD order; capture returned Location/ID
POST {{api}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cus-contoso", "status": "Pending", "amount": 100,
  "priority": "Normal", "createdOn": "2026-09-15",
  "purchaseOrderReference": "PO-MANUAL", "itemsFingerprint": "mouse:5",
  "deliveryAddress": "Madrid"
}

### Edit only a newly created Pending order (never cancel through generic PUT)
PUT {{api}}/orders/PASTE_CREATED_ORDER_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cus-contoso", "status": "Pending", "amount": 110,
  "priority": "Normal", "createdOn": "2026-09-15",
  "purchaseOrderReference": "PO-MANUAL", "itemsFingerprint": "mouse:5",
  "deliveryAddress": "Madrid"
}

### Remove only your newly created Pending order; seed IDs are protected
DELETE {{api}}/orders/PASTE_CREATED_ORDER_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
